[asy]
unitsize(0.5 cm);

draw((-2.5,0)--(2.5,0));
draw((0,-2.5)--(0,2.5));
draw((0,0)--(1.5,1.5));
draw((0,0)--(0,1.5));
draw((0,0)--(0,0));

label("$\sqrt{53}$", (1.25,1.25));
[/asy]

Therefore, $\sqrt{53}$ is $\boxed{\sqrt{53}}$.

